# deploiement/config/flags.map
#
# One-to-one mapping between the 12 vulnerable services and the flag_id
# column of enonce/flags-G04.csv. Format: SERVICE_REF=flag_id, one mapping
# per line. Order is ascending by service number, which places the three N1
# entry points first (E2, E3, E5) followed by the remaining chain A/B/C
# services (E6-E14). Read exactly by flag_id via lib/common.sh:mv_flag_value
# — flag values are never duplicated here or anywhere else in the repo.

E2=1
E3=2
E5=3
E6=4
E7=5
E8=6
E9=7
E10=8
E11=9
E12=10
E13=11
E14=12
